## web-portal/ (Next.js/TypeScript)

### Stack
- Next.js ≥ 14 (App Router)
- TypeScript ≥ 5.0, strict mode
- Tailwind CSS v3
- shadcn/ui components

### Cấu trúc
```
web-portal/src/
├── app/              # Next.js App Router
├── components/       # React components
├── lib/             # Utilities, API clients
├── styles/          # Tailwind + CSS variables
└── middleware.ts    # Auth/routing
```

---

## backend/ (Node.js/Express)

### Stack
- Node.js ≥ 20, TypeScript ≥ 5.0
- Express.js hoặc Fastify
- Prisma ORM
- Zod cho validation
- Winston/Pino cho logging

### Cấu trúc
```
backend/src/
├── config/          # Environment config
├── controllers/     # Request handlers
├── services/        # Business logic
├── repositories/    # Data access
├── middleware/      # Auth, validation, error
├── routes/         # API routes
├── validators/      # Zod schemas
├── utils/          # Logger, response helpers
└── types/          # TypeScript types
```

### Pattern: Controller → Service → Repository
- **Controller**: Handle HTTP request/response, validation
- **Service**: Business logic, không biết HTTP
- **Repository**: Data access, không biết business logic

